{"id": 1135, "title": "Learn Chinese in China", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "learn-chinese-in-china", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1135_learn-chinese-in-china.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["现在，很多外国学生来中国学习。很多人学习汉语。美国人、英国人、泰国人……大家一起上课，一起说汉语。因为喜欢中国，他们认识了很多不同国家的同学和朋友，非常有意思。很多外国学生也希望以后可以在中国工作。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["現在，很多外國學生來中國學習。很多人學習漢語。美國人、英國人、泰国人……大家一起上課，一起說漢語。因為喜歡中國，他們認識了很多不同國家的同學和朋友，非常有意思。很多外國學生也希望以後可以在中國工作。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["xiàn zài， hěn duō wài guó xué shēng lái Zhōng guó xué xí。 hěn duō rén xué xí Hàn yǔ。 Měi guó rén、 Yīng guó rén、 Tài guó rén …… dà jiā yī qǐ shàng kè， yī qǐ shuō Hàn yǔ。 yīn wèi xǐ huan Zhōng guó， tā men rèn shi le hěn duō bù tóng guó jiā de tóng xué hé péng you， fēi cháng yǒu yì si。 hěn duō wài guó xué shēng yě xī wàng yǐ hòu kě yǐ zài Zhōng guó gōng zuò。"], "english_paragraphs": ["These days, many international students come to China to study, and many of them learn Chinese. Americans, British students, Thai students, and others take classes and speak Chinese together. They came because they like China, and they’ve met classmates and friends from many different countries. It’s a lot of fun. Many international students also hope to work in China someday."], "english_full": "These days, many international students come to China to study, and many of them learn Chinese. Americans, British students, Thai students, and others take classes and speak Chinese together. They came because they like China, and they’ve met classmates and friends from many different countries. It’s a lot of fun. Many international students also hope to work in China someday.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn duō\" data-defn=\"many; a lot of\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wài guó\" data-defn=\"foreign country\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">外国</span><span class=\"tr\">外國</span><rt>wài guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué shēng\" data-defn=\"student / schoolchild\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学生</span><span class=\"tr\">學生</span><rt>xué shēng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xí\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn duō\" data-defn=\"many; a lot of\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xí\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Měi guó rén\" data-defn=\"American / American person / American people\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">美国人</span><span class=\"tr\">美國人</span><rt>Měi guó rén</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Yīng guó rén\" data-defn=\"British person; British people\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">英国人</span><span class=\"tr\">英國人</span><rt>Yīng guó rén</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip